From 2201d9c958cef515d08ed000f865aa6f5d5b4a38 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: r1metal <r1metal@localhost>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 10:45:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] input: hynitron: LF line ends in the files the next patches
 change

git am strips the CR from patch lines, so a text patch never applies
to a CRLF file. The seven CST8xx files the next patches change get LF
line ends, and hynitron_esd_check.c loses a stray CR at line 221. The
patch is binary for the same reason.
---
 drivers/input/touchscreen/CST8xx/Makefile     | Bin 610 -> 594 bytes
 .../touchscreen/CST8xx/hynitron_common.h      | Bin 8928 -> 8668 bytes
 .../input/touchscreen/CST8xx/hynitron_core.c  | Bin 60953 -> 58786 bytes
 .../input/touchscreen/CST8xx/hynitron_core.h  | Bin 6986 -> 6721 bytes
 .../touchscreen/CST8xx/hynitron_esd_check.c   | Bin 9690 -> 9349 bytes
 .../input/touchscreen/CST8xx/hynitron_i2c.c   | Bin 5386 -> 5136 bytes
 .../CST8xx/hynitron_update_firmware.c         | Bin 97760 -> 93696 bytes
 7 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)

